trim-feature cli : Tools Lint Fmt Check Install TestCommand BuildCommand AotCompiler Repl Create Upgrade ImageCompiler
  about "The whole `bun` command line: the package manager, the test runner, `bun build`, `bun lint`, `bun fmt`, `bun check` and the ahead-of-time compiler. Includes `\"lint\"`, `\"fmt\"`, `\"check\"`, `\"install\"`, `\"aot\"`, `\"repl\"`, `\"create\"`, `\"upgrade\"` and `\"run\"`. An executable only uses it with `BUN_BE_BUN=1`, with `--help` in `BUN_OPTIONS`, or when it calls `Bun.build()` with `check` or `compile.aot`."
  saves 47.4 44.8

trim-feature lint : Lint
  about "`bun lint`. Included in `\"cli\"`."
  saves 12.2 11.9

trim-feature fmt : Fmt
  about "`bun fmt`. Included in `\"cli\"`. It shares about 8 MB of code with `\"lint\"`, so keeping either one keeps that code."
  saves 0.2 0.0

trim-feature check : Check
  about "`bun check`, `--check`, and type checking and declaration files in `bun build` and `Bun.build()`. Included in `\"cli\"`. It shares the type checker with `\"lint\"` and `\"aot\"`, so keeping any of the three keeps the type checker."
  saves 0.3 0.3

trim-feature install : Install
  about "The package manager: `bun install`, `add`, `remove`, `update`, `link`, `unlink`, `pm` and its subcommands, `patch`, `outdated`, `publish`, `audit`, `why`, `prune`, `dedupe`, `info` and `bunx`. Included in `\"cli\"`. `-i`, `--install` and `install.auto` in `bunfig.toml` need it."
  saves 1.8 1.6

trim-feature aot : AotCompiler ImageCompiler
  about "The ahead-of-time compiler: `bun compile`, `bun build --compile --aot`, `bun run --aot` and `compile.aot` in `Bun.build()`. Included in `\"cli\"`. An executable built with `aot` doesn't need it to run."
  saves 9.6 9.3

trim-feature repl : Repl
  about "`bun repl`. Included in `\"cli\"`."
  saves 0.0 0.0

trim-feature create : Create
  about "`bun create` and `bun init`. Included in `\"cli\"`."
  saves 0.0 0.0

trim-feature upgrade : Upgrade
  about "`bun upgrade`. Included in `\"cli\"`."
  saves 0.0 0.0

trim-feature run : Tools
  about "The rest of the command line: `bun run` with `package.json` scripts and `--filter`, `bun exec`, `--help` and shell completions. Included in `\"cli\"`. The executable doesn't need it to run its own program."
  saves 0.6 0.3

trim-feature spawn : ChildProcess Spawn Shell Cron WebView OpenInEditor Terminal NodeCluster ProcessExecve HotReload CrashReport InternalForTesting BunSpawn
  about "Everything that starts a process: `Bun.spawn()`, `Bun.spawnSync()`, `node:child_process`, `node:cluster`, `Bun.$`, `Bun.cron`, `Bun.WebView`, `Bun.Terminal`, `Bun.openInEditor()`, `process.execve()`, `--watch`, `--hot` and automatic crash reporting. Includes `\"shell\"`, `\"cron\"`, `\"webview\"` and `\"terminal\"`."
  also "`bun` commands that start processes, such as `bun run` and `bunx`"
  saves 1.8 1.3

trim-feature process-kill : ProcessKill
  about "`process.kill()`. Without it, the executable can't send a signal to any process, including itself."
  saves 0.0 0.0

trim-feature process-report : ProcessReport
  about "`process.report`, the Node.js diagnostic report. It lists environment variables, loaded libraries and network interfaces."
  saves 0.0 0.0

trim-feature dialogs : Dialogs
  about "`alert()`, `confirm()` and `prompt()`, which read from the terminal."
  saves 0.0 0.0

trim-feature ipc : Ipc ProcessIpc
  about "IPC with the parent process that started the executable with `ipc` or `fork()`: `process.send()`, `process.disconnect()`, `process.channel`, `process.connected`, and the `\"message\"` and `\"disconnect\"` events. Without it, the executable runs as if it was started without an IPC channel."
  saves 0.0 0.0

trim-feature native-code : Ffi NativeAddons SqliteExtensions
  about "Everything that loads native code: `bun:ffi`, `process.dlopen()`, `.node` addons, and `Database.loadExtension()` in `bun:sqlite`. Includes `\"ffi\"` and `\"native-addons\"`. Without it, `loadExtension()` throws an `SQLiteError`. On macOS, `\"sqlite\"` loads native code too: the system's SQLite library."
  saves 0.7 0.5

trim-feature jit : JIT
  about "The JIT compilers for JavaScript, regular expressions and WebAssembly. An executable built with `aot` never starts them, so `trim` removes them. Without `aot`, `trim` keeps them."
  saves 14.1 14.2

trim-feature interpreter : RuntimeTranspiler DataFileLoaders Interpreter BuiltinSourceText
  about "Everything that runs code that isn't in the executable: the JavaScript parser, the interpreter and the transpiler. `eval()`, `new Function()`, `import()` and `require()` of files that weren't compiled into the executable, `Bun.Transpiler`, `Bun.plugin()`, and built-in modules that your code doesn't import all need it. `trim` only removes it from an executable built with `aot`."
  saves 3.7 2.7

trim-feature bundler : Bundler CssParser ReactCompiler InternalForTesting BuildCommand
  about "`bun build`, `Bun.build()`, HTML imports and the development server in `Bun.serve()`, with the CSS parser and the React Compiler. `Bun.Transpiler` doesn't need it, and neither does importing TypeScript or JSX files at run time."
  saves 6.0 2.5

trim-feature test : Test InternalForTesting TestCommand
  about "`bun test`, `bun:test` and `node:test`: the test runner, `expect()` and its matchers, mocks and snapshots."
  saves 2.1 1.8

trim-feature inspector : Inspector
  about "The debugger: `--inspect`, `BUN_INSPECT` and `node:inspector`. An executable built with `aot` also needs `compile.inspector` before a debugger can attach."
  saves 0.6 0.7

trim-feature profiler : Profilers
  about "The CPU and heap profilers, heap snapshots and code coverage: `--cpu-prof`, `--heap-prof`, `Bun.generateHeapSnapshot()`, `v8.writeHeapSnapshot()` and the profiling functions in `bun:jsc`."
  saves 0.3 0.4

trim-feature source-maps : SourceMaps
  about "Source maps: the ones that the `sourcemap` option embeds in the executable, which stack traces use, and `SourceMap` and `findSourceMap()` in `node:module`."
  saves 0.0 0.0

trim-feature image : Image
  about "`Bun.Image` and `.image()` on a `Blob`."
  saves 1.3 0.9

trim-feature archive : Archive Libarchive
  about "`Bun.Archive`, and everything else that reads or writes a tar archive."
  also "unpacking packages in `bun install`, and `bun pm pack`"
  also "unpacking a template in `bun create`"
  also "installing a missing package during `bun build` or `bun compile`"
  saves 0.0 0.0

trim-feature sqlite : Sqlite SqliteExtensions
  about "`bun:sqlite`, `node:sqlite` and imports with `type: \"sqlite\"`. On macOS, Bun loads the system's SQLite, so this is only the bindings and the loader."
  also "`Bun.SQL` with a `sqlite:` URL"
  saves 1.9 0.0

trim-feature sql : Sql
  about "`Bun.sql` and `Bun.SQL` for PostgreSQL and MySQL."
  saves 0.3 0.3

trim-feature redis : Valkey
  about "`Bun.redis`, `Bun.RedisClient` and `--redis-preconnect`."
  saves 0.3 0.3

trim-feature s3 : S3Responses S3Client
  about "`Bun.s3`, `Bun.S3Client`, and `s3:` URLs in `Bun.file()`, `Bun.write()` and `fetch()`. Without it, an `s3:` URL throws an `Error` whose `code` is `\"ERR_FEATURE_REMOVED\"`."
  also "writing a `Bun.Image` to S3"
  also "receiving an S3 file from another process"
  saves 0.1 0.0

trim-feature html-rewriter : HtmlRewriter
  about "`HTMLRewriter`."
  saves 0.0 0.0

trim-feature ffi : Ffi
  about "`bun:ffi` and its C compiler. Included in `\"native-code\"`."
  saves 0.7 0.5

trim-feature native-addons : NativeAddons
  about "Native addons: `.node` files, `process.dlopen()`, N-API, and the V8 and libuv symbols that addons link against. Included in `\"native-code\"`."
  saves 0.0 0.0

trim-feature webassembly : WebAssembly
  about "`WebAssembly`, `node:wasi` and imports of `.wasm` files."
  saves 1.0 1.1

trim-feature shell : Shell
  about "`Bun.$`, the shell. Included in `\"spawn\"`."
  saves 0.4 0.4

trim-feature webview : WebView
  about "`Bun.WebView`. Included in `\"spawn\"`."
  saves 0.0 0.0

trim-feature fetch : HttpClient Fetch
  about "Bun's HTTP client: `fetch()`, `Bun.fetch()` and `Bun.FetchSession`. `Request`, `Response` and `Headers` don't need it. Neither does `http.request()` in `node:http`, which needs `\"sockets\"`."
  saves 0.3 0.0

trim-feature serve : Serve BunInfo
  about "`Bun.serve()`, and the `node:http` and `node:https` servers, which are built on it. Without it, their `listen()` emits an `\"error\"` event. `fetch()`, `http.request()`, `node:net` and `node:http2` don't need it."
  saves 0.4 0.3

trim-feature sockets : Sockets
  about "`Bun.listen()` and `Bun.connect()`, and everything that opens or accepts a connection through `node:net`: `net.connect()`, `net.createServer().listen()`, `node:tls`, `node:http2`, `http.request()` and `https.request()`. `fetch()`, `WebSocket`, `Bun.serve()`, `Bun.SQL` and `Bun.redis` don't need it."
  saves 0.0 0.0

trim-feature dns : Dns
  about "`Bun.dns` and `node:dns`. Without it, `fetch()`, `Bun.connect()` and `node:net` still resolve host names, but `node:net` doesn't emit `lookup` and `node:dgram` only takes IP addresses."
  saves 0.3 0.3

trim-feature http2 : NodeHttp2 ServeHttp2
  about "`node:http2`, and HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 in `Bun.serve()`."
  saves 0.3 0.0

