  about "HTTP/3 in `Bun.serve()`, and `node:quic`."
  also "`fetch()` over HTTP/3"
  saves 0.5 0.0

trim-feature websocket : WebSocket
  about "The `WebSocket` client. WebSockets in `Bun.serve()` don't need it."
  saves 0.2 0.0

trim-feature udp : Udp
  about "`Bun.udpSocket()` and `node:dgram`."
